sections.text:
Damage is calculated with the following formula:
d a m a g e = l i s t e d d a m a g e ⋅ s k i l l f a c t o r ⋅ m u l t i p l i e r s {\displaystyle damage = listed\,\,damage \cdot skill \,factor \cdot multipliers}
l i s t e d d a m a g e = l i s t e d w e a p o n v a l u e + l i s t e d a m m o v a l u e {\displaystyle listed\, damage = listed\, weapon\, value + listed\, ammo\, value}
s k i l l f a c t o r = { p l a y e r s : min ( [ 0.25 ⋯ 0.55 ] + 0.006 ⋅ s k i l l l e v e l , 1.0 ) e n e m i e s : 0.75 ⋯ 1.0 } {\displaystyle skill\,factor={\begin{Bmatrix}players:\min([0.25\cdots 0.55]+0.006\cdot skill\,level,1.0)\\enemies:{\sqrt {0.75\cdots 1.0}}\end{Bmatrix}}}
m u l t i p l i e r s = b a c k s t a b b o n u s ⋅ s t a g g e r b o n u s ⋅ a t t a c k b o n u s ⋅ m u l t i t a r g e t p e n a l t y ⋅ d a m a g e t y p e m o d i f i e r {\displaystyle multipliers = backstab \ bonus \cdot stagger \ bonus \cdot attack \ bonus \cdot multitarget \ penalty \cdot damage\ type\ modifier}
d a m a g e t a k e n = { a r m o r < d a m a g e 2 : d a m a g e − a r m o r a r m o r ≥ d a m a g e 2 : d a m a g e 2 / ( 4 ⋅ a r m o r ) } {\displaystyle damage\, taken =\begin{Bmatrix} armor<\frac{damage}{2}:damage-armor \\ armor\geq \frac{damage}{2}: damage^2 / (4 \cdot armor) \end{Bmatrix}}
Note: Only players have armor.
